sources.description:
Pick what each device switches to when the activity starts. Leave a field empty and that device is left as it is.

**Source:** {source}
**Volume device:** {volume}
**Also turned on:** {devices}

The lists come from exactly these entities. **Inputs missing** (e.g. Game, Bluetooth)? Check the entity above is the one you see the full list on in Home Assistant — a receiver often has several (Denon AVR, HEOS, Zone 2) and HEOS / Zone 2 report fewer inputs. Go **back** and pick the other entity, or type the input exactly as Home Assistant shows it and press Enter.
